  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida support to AfDB within Urban Policy. Sida prepared concept notes for each of the four sub-themes for the Annual Meeting 2008 and financed three additional short term specialists within various urban-related fields. The finalisation of the project including dissemination of the policy is expected in July 2009.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida-st&#xF6;d till AfDB inom Urban Policy. Sida har finansierat tre specialister inom olika urban-relaterade omr&#xE5;den. Avslutandet av projektet (inkluderande spridning av policyn) f&#xF6;rv&#xE4;ntas bli i juli 2009.</narrative>
